+													<div class="flsm-icon--list-content">
+						<p>Commercial flood insurance protects your business's building and equipment. The policies protect your foundation, utilities, furniture and inventory. Each type of coverage (building and contents) covers up to $500,000 in flood damage.</p>
+
+					</div>
+							</li>
