+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-37-2675.</span> Transfer of vehicle license, tax levy prohibited until license expires.<br /><br />
+	If a license is transferred from one motor vehicle to another, no tax may be levied on the motor vehicle to which the license was transferred until the license expires.<br /><br />
