+	(16)(a) a transfer made to a qualified family member who has legal claim to heirs&#39; property to clear the title of the heirs&#39; property, whereby both the grantor and grantee owned an interest in the property prior to the transfer.<br /><br />
+	(b) For purposes of this item:<br /><br />
