+HISTORY: 2018 Act No. 223 (H.4715), SECTION 8, eff January 1, 2020.<br /><br />
+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-37-3240.</span> Exemptions from boat and watercraft tax.<br /><br />
