+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 40-57-740.</span> Actions against owners and agents.<br /><br />
+	(A) No cause of action may arise against an owner of real estate or licensed real estate agent of a party to a transaction for failure to disclose in a transaction:<br /><br />
+	(1) that the subject real estate is or was occupied by an individual who was infected with a virus or another disease which has been determined by medical evidence as being highly unlikely to be transmitted through occupancy of a dwelling place either presently or previously occupied by the infected individual;<br /><br />
+	(2) that the death of an occupant of a property has occurred or the manner of the death;<br /><br />
