+   "url": "https://www.consumerfinance.gov/rules-policy/regulations/1026/interp-38/",
+   "read": "2026-11-03",
+   "quote": "The costs disclosed under § 1026.38(g)(4) include all real estate brokerage fees, homeowner's or condominium association charges paid at consummation, home warranties, inspection fees, and other fees that are part of the real estate closing"
