+C. We will pay you for direct physical loss
+by or from flood to your insured property if
+you:
+1. Have paid the full amount due (including
+applicable premiums, surcharges, and fees);
+2. Comply with all terms and conditions of
+this policy; and
+3. Have furnished accurate information and
+statements.
+D. We have the right to review the information you give us at any time and revise
