+cost, after demolition or relocation, of elevating or floodproofing a building during its
+rebuilding at the same or another site to
+meet State or local floodplain management
+laws or ordinances, subject to Exclusion
+D.5.g below relating to improvements.
+e. Coverage D will pay to bring a flooddamaged building into compliance with
+State or local floodplain management laws
